  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgrade-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">升級水生</a></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/405/upgrade_aquatic.png\" alt=\"標題圖片\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2><p>這個模組讓升級水生與動態樹木相容，加入了由該模組新增的桑樹的動態生長版本，並在世界生成時完全取代原本的樹木。<br>樹木、其行為和生成方式可透過樹木包自訂與調整。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>功能特色</strong></strong></h2><h4><strong>目前已包含的樹木：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>河畔樹（桑樹）</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>世界生成：</strong></h4><p>動態桑樹將生成於非冰凍的河流中。<br>可透過樹木包自訂此設定。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>其他附加元件</strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">其他模組的動態樹木附加元件可於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木的 CurseForge 頁面</a>找到。<br></span></p><h4><strong>建議與請求</strong></h4><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">如需請求新的模組相容性，請在此處提出！！<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>需求條件</strong></strong></h2><h6>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgrade-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">升級水生</a></h6><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>授權與模組包</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你可以將此模組用於任何你喜歡的模組包！無需詢問。<br>此模組採用 <strong>MIT</strong> 授權，原始碼公開於 GitHub。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
